  "notes": "Yield data from Figure 3 bar charts only (no numeric yield table). Values estimated from figure. Maize yields 4.6-23 t/ha, wheat yields 5.4-8.8 t/ha across 3 sites. The control is mineral fertilizer (MF) providing equivalent P and K. Compost-biochar mixtures = 8 t/ha compost + 4 t/ha biochar. No significant treatment effect on yield at any site. Three biochars from different feedstocks at different pyrolysis temperatures. 4 replicates, RCBD. Text states maize yields ranged 4.6-23 t/ha, wheat 5.4-8.8 t/ha. No differences among treatments were significant for any site or crop."
